usage: reset_all.py [-h] --rig RIG --bench BENCH --boards BOARDS [BOARDS ...]
                    [--hold-s HOLD_S] --out OUT

Pulse reset on several chip/MAC-pinned USB Serial/JTAG boards together. Stop
the host daemon and other serial readers first. This records the reset skew
and USB re-enumeration; traffic after reboot is measured separately.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --rig RIG
  --bench BENCH
  --boards BOARDS [BOARDS ...]
  --hold-s HOLD_S
  --out OUT
